  1++ 6043              ; =========================================================================
  2++ 6043              ; PROJECT126 — ATM Turbo 2+ / NeoGS host-side IPC driver
  3++ 6043              ; Version: P126_ATM_IPC v0.1.0
  4++ 6043              ;
  5++ 6043              ; This is ATM Z80 code. It runs on the 7 MHz host CPU.
  6++ 6043              ; NeoGS is an independent Z80 and has its own private debug port #EF.
  7++ 6043              ;
  8++ 6043              ; The implementation follows the proven Project125 host transport v2
  9++ 6043              ; handshake semantics. It intentionally contains no NeoGS-local IN/OUT
 10++ 6043              ; and does not program DMA_MOD/HAD/MAD/LAD/CST from the ATM side.
 11++ 6043              ; =========================================================================
